o posts? Say goodbye to boring photo posts and hello to eye-catching grids and swipeable panoramas!\n\nInstantGrid lets you effortlessly split your images into fun, attention-grabbing layouts that will make your social media feed the talk of your friends and followers!\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Easy To Use Grid Generator: Turn any picture into a stunning photo grid with customisable rows and columns with a simple, intuitive design.\n\n• Pick Your Style: Choose between classic squares or trendy portrait images to keep your content fresh and exciting.\n\n• Intelligent Panorama Mode: Got a stunning panorama from your holiday adventures? InstantGrid automatically switches to Pano Mode and figures out exactly how many columns you need for a swipeable, jaw-dropping panoramic view!\n\n• See It Before You Share It: Preview your grids and panoramas to make sure everything looks amazing before exporting and posting - no surprises, just perfect posts.\n\nWhether it’s a birthday, wedding, holiday, or just a spontaneous moment, InstantGrid helps you turn memories into scroll-stopping posts.\nIt’s perfect for personal profiles and a powerful tool for influencers, content creators, and brands who want to stand out.\n\nReady to level up your feed? Download InstantGrid now and start creating posts that pop!", "minimumOsVersion": "26.0", "bundleId": "co.uk.smudgeinc.InstantGrid", "price": 4400.0, "userRatingCount": 0}]}